sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Grieneisen et al. (2007) Nature & Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature reverse-fountain root tip auxin reflux capacitor, Quiescent Center exponential accumulation, and PLETHORA meristem zonality — MorphoEval overall 93.2/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2014-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain.py` (overall weighted score: 93.3/100, up from 54.4/100 in v1). The remediated script implements the 2D 5-tissue Arabidopsis root tip cellular lattice solver (stele, endodermis/pericycle, cortex, epidermis/LRC, and columella/QC) verifying exact vascular-epidermal counter-current flux conservation (|J_stele + J_epidermis| = 2e-15); reproduces all 6 Grieneisen et al. (2007) & Mähönen et al. (2014) experimental regimes (Wild-Type 132.05x QC peak, shoot decapitation J_in=0 retaining 115.56x / 87.5% autonomy, pin2/eir1 shootward loss, k_lat=0 lateral reflux ablation, NPA polar transport blockade 1.31x, and QC laser-ablation proximal regeneration shifting the QC peak from 37.5 um to 97.5 um; meristem boundary Pearson r = 0.9929, p = 7.47e-5); and segments the SHA-256-locked 3-panel Arabidopsis primary root meristem confocal micrograph (`arabidopsis_root_meristem_specimen.jpg`, N = 113 DAPI nuclei, N = 125 mitotic divisions, spacing 18.3394 +- 0.5790 px SE). Overall 93.2/100 (faithfulness 92.9, reproducibility 93.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/root_auxin_reflux_fountain_comparison.png: rendered output of 2014-grieneisen-root-auxin-reflux-fountain.py at 8871db0, image/png, 723230 B, 2475×1470 px, artifact_sha256 12e908c56deebba7631ec0c11c4291b5a4c995e66a43e76a97072750537346c4 (sha256 12e908c56deebba7631ec0c11c4291b5a4c995e66a43e76a97072750537346c4), spec_fingerprint 5f9ff984dd3572c3a2bb1124d68b38a94c8ae92664796e5dd367404918a3bd5f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 5f9ff984dd3572c3a2bb1124d68b38a94c8ae92664796e5dd367404918a3bd5f; artifact_sha256: 12e908c56deebba7631ec0c11c4291b5a4c995e66a43e76a97072750537346c4; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/arabidopsis_root_meristem_specimen.jpg=1b962c21e75c8e72..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/paper_citations.bib=069ef06b9ad6bdfb..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/root_auxin_reflux_fountain_reference.json=1fc68ce109094fc5..., datasets/root_auxin_reflux_fountain/scout_manifest.json=285fff11a61df708...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-root-auxin-reflux-fountain-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Grieneisen, Xu, Marée, Hogeweg & Scheres (2007) Nature 449:1008-1013 2D multi-file root apex reverse-fountain auxin reflux loop (downward PIN1 stele transport +v_s, lateral PIN3/PIN4/PIN7 columella/QC redistribution, upward PIN2 epidermal/LRC transport -v_e, and inward lateral PIN1/PIN2/PIN3 reflux k_lat across cortex/endodermis), generating an exponential Quiescent Center (QC) auxin capacitor (>100-fold peak) that remains self-sustaining after shoot decapitation (J_in = 0) and regenerates a shifted proximal QC peak after distal laser ablation | Mähönen et al. (2014) Nature 515:125-129 slow auxin-induced PLETHORA (PLT1/PLT2) transcription factor synthesis, cell-to-cell movement, and growth dilution creating a smooth axial PLT dosage gradient that positions Meristematic Zone (P >= Theta_MZ), Elongation Zone (Theta_EZ <= P < Theta_MZ), and Differentiation Zone (P < Theta_EZ) boundaries; reconstructed_in_script: 2D 5-tissue root tip cellular lattice solver (32 axial rows x 9 radial files: epidermis/LRC, cortex, endodermis/pericycle, stele, and distal columella/QC) verifying counter-current vascular-epidermal flux conservation (error 2e-15 <= 1e-12) and reproducing all 6 experimental regimes: Wild-Type (132.05x QC amplification at z=37.5 um), shoot decapitation J_in=0 autonomy (115.56x, retaining 87.5% of WT peak), pin2/eir1 mutant (54.1x, z_MZ=210 um), lateral-PIN ablation k_lat=0 (10.38x, z_MZ=90 um), NPA blockade (1.31x, z_MZ=0 um), and QC laser ablation regenerating a proximal QC peak at z=97.5 um (+60 um shift) | Coupled PLETHORA (PLT1/2) reaction-diffusion-dilution solver achieving Pearson r = 0.9929 (p = 7.47e-5) against published Meristematic Zone boundaries across all 6 perturbation regimes and r = 0.9851 along the WT axial profile | Empirical CV segmentation of the 3-panel Arabidopsis thaliana primary root meristem confocal micrograph (`arabidopsis_root_meristem_specimen.jpg`, CC BY-SA 4.0, 1527x513 px) extracting root meristem area fraction (0.2561), N = 113 DAPI-stained nuclei (intercellular spacing 18.3394 +- 0.5790 px SE), N = 125 Alexa Fluor 488 mitotic phragmoplast/spindle divisions, and apical-to-proximal nuclear density ratio (1.1182); transfer_boundary: 2D radial-axial 5-tissue cellular root apex reflux capacitor and PLETHORA dosage thresholds mapped to confocal Arabidopsis root meristem nuclear and mitotic architecture; does_not_claim: Subcellular cell-wall mechanical viscoplasticity or 3D gravitropic root bending curvature." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D 5-tissue auxin-PLETHORA root tip lattice to a growing cellular vertex/CPM mechanics solver with explicit mitotic cell division and asymmetric gravistimulation (PIN3/PIN7 columella relocalization) to model dynamic root bending." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.932"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 038 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

